    "Description": "...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_003",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "아, 안녕 존.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_004",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_005",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "대체 언제쯤이면 네가 존같이 생겼다는 걸 인정할거야, 길?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_006",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "내가 너를 쥴스라고 부를 수 있게 허락해줄 때 쯤.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_007",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "시끄러워.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_008",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "괜찮아? 생각이 다른데 가있는 것 같은데.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_009",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "보스는 어디 있어?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_010",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "글쎄. 뭣 좀 사러 밖에 나갔...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_011",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "내가 방금 한 말 들었어?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_012",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "무슨 말 했어?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_013",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "했어. 너, 역시 딴 생각에 빠져 있는 것 같아. 그것도 아주 심하게.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_014",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "별거 아니야 조금 생각할게 있어서.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_015",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "그게 뭔데?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_016",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "음, 매월 30일에 월세를 내는게 엄청 스트레스거든, 그리고-",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_017",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "아.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_018",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "(어제는 1시간 동안 혼자 떠들었다고 오해받는 일이 생기질않나.)",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_019",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "(이틀 전에는 이곳이 폐쇄될 위기에 처했다는 것까지 알게됐지)",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_020",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "(삶의 기반도 흔들리게 됐는데, 정신까지 나가버릴 지경이라고.)",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_021",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "(게다가 포어에게 중성화 수술을 시켜주느라 지갑 속 마지막 동전 하나까지 다써버렸지. 월세를 한번만 더 미뤘다간 쫒겨날거야...)",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_022",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "(아, 그러고 보니 내 아파트 방바닥에 맥주 캔들이 엄청나게 널브러져 있었지. 또...)",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_023",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "질!",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_024",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "미안, 무슨 말 했어?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_025",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "...정말 오늘 일할 수 있는 거 맞아?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_026",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "당연하지!",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_027",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "그럼 우리 기초 과정부터 한번 다시 확인해 보자고. 괜찮지? 혹시 모르니까 말야",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_028",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_029",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "네가 피아노 맨을 만들 수 있을 정도 상태면, 나머지 과정은 생략할게. 그래도 웬만하면 잠ᄁᆞᆫ 참고 나랑 어울려줘, 괜찮지?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_030",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_031",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "우선 슈가 러쉬부터 시작해보자.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_032",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "칵테일 조합법에 있는 탐색 막대를 이용해 레시피를 확인해 봐. 왼쪽 상단에 표시될거야.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_033",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "또 맛이나 종류 기준으로 검색할 수 있어. \"달콤한\" 술이나 \"남성적인\" 술을 정렬시켜 볼 수 있다는 거야.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_034",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "오른쪽 가운데에 있는 셰이커에 재료를 원하는 양만큼 클릭해서 넣어.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_035",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "길...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_036",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "그러고 난 다음, 섞기 버튼을 누르면 돼. 다시 눌러서 섞는 걸 멈출 수 있고.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_037",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "다 끝나면 서빙하기 버튼을 눌러서 손님에게 전해주면 돼. 그게 다야.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_038",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "아, 만약 제조에 실패했다면 리셋 버튼을 눌러서 다시 시도할 수 있어.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_039",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "리셋 버튼은 아무 때나 누를 수 있어. 셰이커가 움직이고 있을 때도 말이지. 부담 가지지 말고 원할 때 눌러.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_040",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "길리안, 나 공식적인 BTC 교육을 받고 여기 온 거거든?",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_041",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_gillian_01",
    "Description": "그럼 문제없이 만들어 낼 수 있겠네!",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_042",
    "CharacterDataId": "character_jill_01",
    "Description": "하아...",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
  {
    "Id": "dialogue_tutorial_1_1_043",
    "CharacterDataId": null,
    "Description": "길이 슈가 러쉬나 피아노 맨을 달라는군. 만약에 망쳤다면, 재시도 버튼을 눌러서 다시 하면 되겠지.",
    "NextDialogueId": null,
    "SelectionNameList": null,
    "SelectionDialogueIdList": null,
    "TexturePath": null,
    "VoicePath": null
  },
